shed phrase left die hard  marvel fans in a tizzy until endgame  finally soothed their pain as the  climactic end battle kicks off and the  avengers and their allies pour through  portals all over the battlefield captain  america finally gets to utter the  long-awaited line with an immensely  satisfying  avengers  assemble  with the thanos narrative in the rear  view mirror the mcu came back down to  earth to wrap things up in spider-man  far from home the film served as a  fitting coda to the massive infinity  saga as it showed peter parker  processing the loss of his mentor tony  stark while understanding that it was  time to move on to the next adventure  once again it's the final moments of the  film that tend to linger most with  viewers as he swings through new york on  a date with mj peter is suddenly  confronted with a news report that  reveals his secret identity but the most  shocking element of the report is who  delivers it j jonah jameson played by  j.k simmons reprising his role from sam  raimi's spider-man trilogy what simmons  appearance means for the rest of the mcu  remains to be seen but the unexpected  twist instantly made his cameo the most  iconic part of the entire movie  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the marvel cinematic universe are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Applause]  [Music]
 

